SUMMARY:AWS Certifications & Career Success Workshop
DESCRIPTION:AWS SBG at Florida International University\nJoin the AWS Stud
 ent Builder Group for an interactive workshop focused on earning AWS certi
 fications\, building practical cloud skills\, and standing out in today’
 s competitive tech job market.\n\n**Room: INV1 - 201**\n\n**What to Expect
 :**\n\n**Career & Hiring Insights:** Learn what recruiters look for and ho
 w to stand out in cloud and tech roles.\n\n**Student & Intern Panel:** Hea
 r firsthand experiences from AWS-certified students who have secured inter
 nships.\n\n**AWS Exam Prep:** Discover effective study strategies\, exam t
 ips\, and common mistakes to avoid.\n\n**Free Study Resources:** Explore f
 ree AWS training materials\, practice exams\, and hands-on learning opport
 unities.\n\n**Resume & Portfolio Building:** Learn how to showcase AWS pro
 jects and technical skills to strengthen your applications.\nFree food and
  refreshments will be provided!\n\nWhether you're just getting started wit
 h AWS or preparing for your next certification or internship\, this worksh
 op will help you take the next step in your cloud career.
